  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I wanna kiss you when I hate you and then leave instead",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I wanna kill you, then I call you and say, \"Get in my bed\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Been a full year now and we both know that it's bound to end",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But kinda like just how hot it gets",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So stay for the night",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It'll bury the crime",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tell me a lie",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It'll buy us some time",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, one more minute, it all burns down",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "They're all telling us to get out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But you and I, and I",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "We'd keep living in a burning house",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Might be crazy to stick this out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But we can't see all the flames around",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You and I, and I",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We're just dancing to the siren sounds",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I can get real cold when I need you, and you don't show up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You can get cocky when you want me, and I say, \"I'm done\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Been a full year now, and we both know it's not good for us",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But we both love the smoke in our lungs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
